MODULE: ReturnReacquiresTimer
TARGET: NoAwaitedDrive
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: returning a foreground call reacquires the exclusive timer turn during a drive
PERTURBS: CallReturn

--- FIND
CallReturn(g) ==
    /\ turn[g] = "call"
    /\ turn' = ReleaseTurn(g)
    /\ UNCHANGED <<queued, served, operation, timer, age>>
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: returning a foreground call reacquires the exclusive timer turn during a drive
CallReturn(g) ==
    /\ turn[g] = "call"
    /\ turn' = HoldTurn(g, "timer")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<queued, served, operation, timer, age>>
--- END
